      <prov:hadRole rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/odrl_prov#GeneratorRole"/>
    </prov:Association>
  </prov:qualifiedAssociation>
  <vaem:rationale>The ontology models all supplied classes, properties, and individuals to answer each atomic competency question. SubClassOf axioms establish the hierarchy for rights and expressions. Domain and range axioms align with Themis tests, with additional domain axioms added where properties apply to multiple classes. Individuals are declared as instances of Operator.</vaem:rationale>
</prov:Activity>

